{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21958","headline":"紫藤 · 白居易","name":"紫藤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藤花紫蒙茸，藤叶青扶疎。\n谁谓好颜色，而爲害有余。\n下如蛇屈盘，上若绳萦纡。\n可怜中间树，束缚成枯株。\n柔蔓不自胜，嫋嫋挂空虚。\n岂知缠树木，千夫力不如。\n先柔後爲害，有似谀佞徒。\n附着君权势，君迷不肯诛。\n又如妖妇人，绸缪蛊其夫。\n奇邪坏人室，夫惑不能除。\n寄言邦与家，所慎在其初。\n毫末不早辨，滋蔓信难图。\n愿以藤爲戒，铭之于座隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}